---
---
<section
  class="relative bg-navy-deep text-white py-[50px] overflow-hidden"
  style="background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(10,20,35,0.96) 50%, rgba(10,20,35,0.70) 100%), url('/Asset/stock%20photo/Desktop%20Dimensions/CTA.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"
>
  <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-gold"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-[25px] sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">

      <!-- Left: Copy -->
      <div>
        <p class="text-gold font-body text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-6 h-px bg-gold inline-block"></span>
          Our Promise
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display mb-8">
          We Don't Give Up On People
        </h2>

        <!-- For the person seeking help -->
        <div class="mb-8 border-l-2 border-gold/40 pl-5">
          <p class="font-body text-white/85 text-base leading-relaxed mb-3">
            <strong class="text-white font-bold">If you're the one struggling:</strong> you don't have to have everything figured out before you call. You don't have to be at rock bottom. You don't have to be certain you're ready. You just have to be willing to try — and we'll meet you exactly where you are.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- For families -->
        <div class="mb-10 border-l-2 border-white/30 pl-5">
          <p class="font-body text-white/85 text-base leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-white font-bold">If you're a family member:</strong> you already know what it feels like to watch someone you love disappear into addiction. You've tried everything. You're exhausted, maybe angry, maybe both. That's completely valid. And you need to know this: calling for someone else is an act of love, not betrayal. We'll walk you through every option.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="font-body text-white/60 text-sm italic mb-10">
          Tenacity is one of our core values. We don't quit on people — and we don't let them quit on themselves.
        </p>

        <a href="tel:8883625576" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-white hover:bg-cream text-navy font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded transition-colors font-body tracking-wide">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
            <path d="M2 3a1 1 0 011-1h2.153a1 1 0 01.986.836l.74 4.435a1 1 0 01-.54 1.06l-1.548.773a11.037 11.037 0 006.105 6.105l.774-1.548a1 1 0 011.059-.54l4.435.74a1 1 0 01.836.986V17a1 1 0 01-1 1h-2C7.82 18 2 12.18 2 5V3z"/>
          </svg>
          Call Now — We're Here 24/7
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Stats -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-5">
        {[
          ['20+', 'Years of combined clinical experience on our team'],
          ['74', 'Total beds across detox & residential care'],
          ['11', 'Evidence-based therapy modalities offered'],
          ['12', 'Aftercare & alumni support programs post-discharge'],
        ].map(([num, label]) => (
          <div class="bg-white/8 border border-white/12 rounded-xl p-[17px] sm:p-6 backdrop-blur-sm">
            <div class="font-display text-5xl text-gold mb-2">{num}</div>
            <p class="font-body text-white/70 text-sm leading-snug">{label}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
